  "note": "Curated source portraits for the face pack. Congressional members are resolved automatically from unitedstates/images by bioguide (see build_face_pack.py) and are NOT listed here. Every entry below was produced by discover_commons.py and then eyeballed on a contact sheet. The licence check is a RECORD, not a gate (owner decision, 2026-08): every entry still carries its verified licence, author/Artist and a ready-to-use attributionCaption, but public domain is no longer required to ship -- see facepack.py's licence_tier for how PD is still preferred where available. Leave an entry out entirely only when NO licence can be recorded, or the right-person identification is not confident -- a gap is still cheaper than a wrong face or an unattributable one.",
